<title>SRI LANKA: National up 1.5 pct on foreign buying.</title>
<headline>National up 1.5 pct on foreign buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Development Bank Ltd rose 1.5 percent or three rupees to 200 in early Monday trading on foreign buying of 100,000 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The share is very good value at current levels, because it went over 400 rupees the last time the market rallied,&quot; said a broker with a foreign joint venture.</p>
<p>NDB is one of two development finance institutions listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
